{"total": 47.45, "lines": [{"text": "Esse é o Alfredo. Catorze anos. Primeiro dia na escola nova.", "s": 0.35, "e": 4.704, "chunks": [[{"w": "Esse", "s": 0.41, "e": 0.736, "c": ""}, {"w": "é", "s": 0.736, "e": 0.884, "c": ""}, {"w": "o", "s": 0.884, "e": 1.032, "c": ""}], [{"w": "Alfredo.", "s": 1.032, "e": 1.683, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "Catorze", "s": 1.683, "e": 2.186, "c": "y"}, {"w": "anos.", "s": 2.186, "e": 2.66, "c": ""}], [{"w": "Primeiro", "s": 2.66, "e": 3.222, "c": ""}, {"w": "dia", "s": 3.222, "e": 3.489, "c": ""}, {"w": "na", "s": 3.489, "e": 3.696, "c": ""}], [{"w": "escola", "s": 3.696, "e": 4.14, "c": ""}, {"w": "nova.", "s": 4.14, "e": 4.614, "c": "y"}]]}, {"text": "Ele veio do interior com a mãe, a dona Tânia, e trouxe um plano perfeito.", "s": 5.054, "e": 9.024, "chunks": [[{"w": "Ele", "s": 5.114, "e": 5.314, "c": ""}, {"w": "veio", "s": 5.314, "e": 5.558, "c": ""}, {"w": "do", "s": 5.558, "e": 5.713, "c": ""}], [{"w": "interior", "s": 5.713, "e": 6.136, "c": "y"}, {"w": "com", "s": 6.136, "e": 6.335, "c": ""}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.335, "e": 6.447, "c": ""}], [{"w": "mãe,", "s": 6.447, "e": 6.757, "c": ""}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.757, "e": 6.869, "c": ""}, {"w": "dona", "s": 6.869, "e": 7.113, "c": ""}], [{"w": "Tânia,", "s": 7.113, "e": 7.513, "c": "y"}, {"w": "e", "s": 7.513, "e": 7.624, "c": ""}, {"w": "trouxe", "s": 7.624, "e": 7.957, "c": ""}], [{"w": "um", "s": 7.957, "e": 8.112, "c": ""}, {"w": "plano", "s": 8.112, "e": 8.401, "c": ""}, {"w": "perfeito.", "s": 8.401, "e": 8.934, "c": "y"}]]}, {"text": "Chegar de tênis novo, sentar no fundo, e virar o mais popular da sala.", "s": 9.374, "e": 13.264, "chunks": [[{"w": "Chegar", "s": 9.434, "e": 9.774, "c": ""}, {"w": "de", "s": 9.774, "e": 9.933, "c": ""}, {"w": "tênis", "s": 9.933, "e": 10.228, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "novo,", "s": 10.228, "e": 10.59, "c": ""}, {"w": "sentar", "s": 10.59, "e": 10.93, "c": ""}, {"w": "no", "s": 10.93, "e": 11.089, "c": ""}], [{"w": "fundo,", "s": 11.089, "e": 11.497, "c": "y"}, {"w": "e", "s": 11.497, "e": 11.61, "c": ""}, {"w": "virar", "s": 11.61, "e": 11.905, "c": ""}], [{"w": "o", "s": 11.905, "e": 12.018, "c": ""}, {"w": "mais", "s": 12.018, "e": 12.267, "c": ""}, {"w": "popular", "s": 12.267, "e": 12.652, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "da", "s": 12.652, "e": 12.811, "c": ""}, {"w": "sala.", "s": 12.811, "e": 13.174, "c": ""}]]}, {"text": "Mas o tênis descolou na escada.", "s": 13.814, "e": 15.845, "chunks": [[{"w": "Mas", "s": 13.874, "e": 14.106, "c": ""}, {"w": "o", "s": 14.106, "e": 14.235, "c": ""}, {"w": "tênis", "s": 14.235, "e": 14.57, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "descolou", "s": 14.57, "e": 15.059, "c": "r"}, {"w": "na", "s": 15.059, "e": 15.24, "c": ""}, {"w": "escada.", "s": 15.24, "e": 15.755, "c": "y"}]]}, {"text": "Só tinha vaga na primeira fila.", "s": 16.845, "e": 18.773, "chunks": [[{"w": "Só", "s": 16.905, "e": 17.076, "c": ""}, {"w": "tinha", "s": 17.076, "e": 17.392, "c": ""}, {"w": "vaga", "s": 17.392, "e": 17.66, "c": ""}], [{"w": "na", "s": 17.66, "e": 17.831, "c": ""}, {"w": "primeira", "s": 17.831, "e": 18.293, "c": "y"}, {"w": "fila.", "s": 18.293, "e": 18.683, "c": ""}]]}, {"text": "E na chamada... a voz desafinou.", "s": 19.773, "e": 21.688, "chunks": [[{"w": "E", "s": 19.833, "e": 19.952, "c": ""}, {"w": "na", "s": 19.952, "e": 20.119, "c": ""}, {"w": "chamada…", "s": 20.119, "e": 20.644, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "a", "s": 20.644, "e": 20.763, "c": ""}, {"w": "voz", "s": 20.763, "e": 20.978, "c": ""}, {"w": "desafinou.", "s": 20.978, "e": 21.598, "c": "r"}]]}, {"text": "No recreio, a marmita da mãe: ovo cozido com cebola. A mesa esvaziou.", "s": 23.788, "e": 28.398, "chunks": [[{"w": "No", "s": 23.848, "e": 24.038, "c": ""}, {"w": "recreio,", "s": 24.038, "e": 24.632, "c": "y"}], [{"w": "a", "s": 24.632, "e": 24.767, "c": ""}, {"w": "marmita", "s": 24.767, "e": 25.227, "c": ""}, {"w": "da", "s": 25.227, "e": 25.416, "c": ""}], [{"w": "mãe:", "s": 25.416, "e": 25.794, "c": ""}, {"w": "ovo", "s": 25.794, "e": 26.037, "c": "y"}, {